  "title": "exported_pdu: Correctly handle padded values",
  "description": "Previously, the exported_pdu dissector would not pad values at all,\ncausing the dissector to begin looking for the next option in the middle\nof the padding, including in files exported directly from Wireshark.\n\nThis change brings the exported_pdu into line with the comments in\nexported_pdu.h by skipping over padding values and starting all reads\nat 4-byte aligned offsets.\n\nFixes #17535.",
